  "solution": "The pattern followed here is:\n\nThe equation is solved with the help of the BODMAS Rule:\n\nLet's check each option one by one.\n\n**Option 1) **-, ÷, ×, = \n\n⇒ 23 - __**2 ÷ 2 **__× 5 = 18\n\n⇒ 23 - __**1 × 5 **__= 18\n\n⇒ 23 - 5 = 18\n\n⇒ 18 = 18\n\n⇒ **LHS = RHS**\n\n**Option 2) **-, ÷, +, =\n\n⇒ 23 - __**2 ÷ 2**__ + 5 = 18\n\n⇒ __**23 **__- 1 __**+ 5**__ = 18\n\n⇒ 28 - 1 = 18\n\n⇒ 27 ≠ 18\n\n⇒ **LHS ≠ RHS**\n\n**Option 3) **-, ÷, =, +\n\n⇒ 23 - __**2 ÷ 2**__ = 5 + 18\n\n⇒ __**23 - 1**__ = __**5 + 18**__\n\n⇒ 22 ≠ 23\n\n⇒ **LHS ≠ RHS**\n\n**Option 4) **-, ×, ÷, = \n\n⇒ 23 - 2 × __**2 ÷ 5 **__= 18\n\n⇒ 23 - __**2 × 0.4**__ = 18\n\n⇒ __**23 - 0.8**__ = 18\n\n⇒ 22.2 ≠ 18\n\n⇒ **LHS ≠ RHS**\n\nHence, the correct answer is **\"Option 1\".**",
